5c3-93d8-00f6c4932aac", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:34:20.061Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch23EcB1RC8PFoVP135qn", "wire_tool_inputs": {"toolu_01P9WVpx6gmDhT2GRcUStCXi": {"verdict": "PASS", "confidence": 0.5, "notes": "Filed 2 reports; only 1 confirmed as a bug and logged.\n1) Profile > View Combat Gear opens Combat on the Dungeons tab instead of the Gear tab (reproduced twice; developer confirmed and logged).\n2) Bronze Bar craft dialog XP total (qty 11 -> +68, 21 -> +130, 25 -> +155 vs 6 XP/bar) was reported; the developer could not reproduce it with my steps, so it is not logged as a bug. Confidence is low on this area.\nChecked and found OK: smithing list and Tool filter, owned counts vs inventory, Mining ore list (sorted by level 1,1,1,10,15,20,30,40, XP values = rate x 60), gear slot choosers (Head, Body, Cape) reload from inventory, equip/unequip updates stats (DEF 70+5+95=170, +16 helmet=186, unequip=91), gear state persists after rotation and tab changes.\nNot covered: Crafting batch dialog (no craftable crafting recipe was affordable, so the Crafting XP readout was not exercised), starting a Mining session, Legs/Ring/Necklace/Shield choosers, Equip Best Gear. Debug 'Modify Item Count' button is visible on the Profile inventory (out of scope; I opened it and cancelled without changing anything)."}}, "tool_use_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01P9WVpx6gmDhT2GRcUStCXi", "display_name": "Sign Off", "server_display_name": "aqb-device", "tool_name": "sign_off"}]}
