{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch23F2pL1hjSVTe9j7ucx", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with a PASS verdict at 0.5 confidence. I logged one confirmed bug and left one unconfirmed issue out of the logged reports.\n\n**Logged bug**\n- **Profile > \"View Combat Gear\" opens the Dungeons tab, not Gear.** The link opens Combat on the Dungeons tab, so the Gear section isn't shown. I reproduced it twice, and the developer confirmed it.\n\n**Not logged**\n- **Bronze Bar craft dialog XP total.** Totals scale at about 6.2 XP per bar (11 bars → +68, 21 → +130, 25 → +155), while the list and the single-bar readout show 6 XP per bar. The developer could not reproduce it with my steps, so it is not a logged bug. This is the area I'm least sure of.\n\n**Checked and working**\n- Smithing list, the Tool filter, and owned counts against the inventory.\n- Mining ore list: sorted by level (1, 1, 1, 10, 15, 20, 30, 40), and XP equals rate × 60.\n- Gear slot choosers for Head, Body and Cape reload from the inventory.\n- Equip and unequip update the stats: DEF goes 91 → 170 → 186 with the helmet, and back to 91 after unequipping the platebody.\n- Gear state survives rotation and switching tabs.\n\n**Not covered**\n- The Crafting batch dialog: I couldn't afford any craftable recipe with this inventory, so its XP readout was not exercised.\n- Starting a Mining session.\n- Legs, Ring, Necklace and Shield choosers, and Equip Best Gear.\n\n**Notes**\n- The Profile inventory shows a \"[Debug] Modify Item Count\" button. It's outside the sweep, and I cancelled the dialog I opened by accident without changing anything. It may be worth checking before release.\n- My Back press didn't leave the Combat screen once, which is how I landed on that debug dialog."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1075, "cache_read_input_tokens": 168549, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1075}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "88e2c6ae-5bf7-4156-97c6-63c5c180ebf8", "uuid": "1ef756d8-69e5-4d87-a4fb-6e866acc15a2", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:34:23.452Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch23F2aCFH3EEWjxsmtV6"}
